    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Sabato Urciuoli, London-based Italian product design director, 15 yrs. Career: Head of Design at Push Doctor (2018-19), Product Designer at Meta Reality Labs (2020-21), Design Lead at Fantasy (2021), Creative Director (Spatial/Immersive) at AKQA (2021-22), VP Product and Design at Jadu AR (2022-23), Principal Designer at PayPal, now at Raw Materials (2025). Most prominent public work: Jadu AR, a first-of-its-kind multiplayer AR fighting game (iOS/Android, 2023). Portfolio site sabato.studio now shows a single image (a blue cap saying 'I DON'T WORK HERE'), suggesting he is in a transitional/freelance period. Earlier portfolio (via CommArts, 2020) showed named case studies for Google Chromebook and Bandcamp. IG @sabato.studio queued for logged-in grab (headless rate-limited). Work Status note: scout set Employed at Jadu per LinkedIn/site in 2021; current role per search is Raw Materials (Milano-based), site does not confirm. Status may need an update from Jonathan.",
